# WHITELIST — this repo is PUBLIC.
#
# Everything is ignored by default. A file reaches GitHub only if it is
# un-ignored below. That way a new planning doc dropped into this folder is
# excluded automatically, instead of relying on someone remembering to add it.
#
# Never un-ignore: TIME_EFFORT.md (rates, margins), OPEN_QUESTIONS.md and
# DOU.md (payment structure), the proposal .docx, or anything with a client's
# details in it.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!index.html
!config.example.json
!config.json
!apps-script/
!apps-script/*.gs
